  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 759971,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 18 Wheeler - American Pro Trucker (PlayStation 2)\n\nExperience the thrill of cross-country trucking in *18 Wheeler - American Pro Trucker*! Embark on a high-octane journey from Key West to San Francisco, battling the clock and a relentless rival, the \"Lizard Tail,\" to reach the finish line. Choose from a diverse roster of drivers, each commanding a unique truck with distinct attributes. \n\nMaster the art of trucking with strategic gameplay: ram special vans for extra time, blast your horn to clear the road, and utilize slipstreaming to gain bursts of speed.  Manage your cargo wisely – select from challenging, high-reward trailers or easier, lower-paying options, all while avoiding costly damage. \n\nBetween stages, engage in mini-games to boost your earnings.  *18 Wheeler* delivers intense, hardcore truck racing action, demanding skill in maneuvering massive vehicles, precise parking, and clever tactics to outmaneuver your competition and claim victory.  Haul everything from cable cars to gas tanks in this authentic American trucking adventure!"
    },
